  "snippets": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "In 1796, the scientist Edward Jenner",
      "start_seconds": 7.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.351
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "injected material from a cowpox virus\ninto an eight-year-old boy",
      "start_seconds": 10.441,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "with a hunch that this would provide\nthe protection needed",
      "start_seconds": 15.111,
      "duration_seconds": 2.767
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "to save people from deadly outbreaks\nof the related smallpox virus.",
      "start_seconds": 17.878,
      "duration_seconds": 5.365
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "It was a success.",
      "start_seconds": 23.243,
      "duration_seconds": 1.647
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The eight-year-old was inoculated\nagainst the disease",
      "start_seconds": 24.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.729
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "and this became the first ever vaccine.",
      "start_seconds": 27.619,
      "duration_seconds": 3.311
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "But why did it work?",
      "start_seconds": 30.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.793
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "To understand how vaccines function,",
      "start_seconds": 32.723,
      "duration_seconds": 1.934
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "we need to know how the immune system\ndefends us against contagious diseases",
      "start_seconds": 34.657,
      "duration_seconds": 4.461
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "in the first place.",
      "start_seconds": 39.118,
      "duration_seconds": 1.797
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "When foreign microbes invade us,",
      "start_seconds": 40.915,
      "duration_seconds": 2.156
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "the immune system triggers\na series of responses",
      "start_seconds": 43.071,
      "duration_seconds": 3.053
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "in an attempt to identify\nand remove them from our bodies.",
      "start_seconds": 46.124,
      "duration_seconds": 3.632
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "The signs that this immune\nresponse is working",
      "start_seconds": 49.756,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "are the coughing, sneezing,\ninflammation and fever we experience,",
      "start_seconds": 52.806,
      "duration_seconds": 4.694
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "which work to trap, deter and rid the body\nof threatening things, like bacteria.",
      "start_seconds": 57.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.914
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "These innate immune responses\nalso trigger our second line of defense,",
      "start_seconds": 63.414,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "called adaptive immunity.",
      "start_seconds": 67.824,
      "duration_seconds": 2.374
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Special cells called B cells and T cells\nare recruited to fight microbes,",
      "start_seconds": 70.198,
      "duration_seconds": 4.915
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "and also record information about them,",
      "start_seconds": 75.113,
      "duration_seconds": 3.218
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "creating a memory of what\nthe invaders look like,",
      "start_seconds": 78.331,
      "duration_seconds": 3.148
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "and how best to fight them.",
      "start_seconds": 81.479,
      "duration_seconds": 2.568
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "This know-how becomes handy",
      "start_seconds": 84.047,
      "duration_seconds": 1.893
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "if the same pathogen\ninvades the body again.",
      "start_seconds": 85.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.532
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "But despite this smart response,\nthere's still a risk involved.",
      "start_seconds": 89.472,
      "duration_seconds": 4.048
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "The body takes time to learn\nhow to respond to pathogens",
      "start_seconds": 93.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.176
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "and to build up these defenses.",
      "start_seconds": 96.696,
      "duration_seconds": 2.061
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "And even then,",
      "start_seconds": 98.757,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "if a body is too weak or young\nto fight back when it's invaded,",
      "start_seconds": 99.767,
      "duration_seconds": 3.412
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "it might face very serious risk\nif the pathogen is particularly severe.",
      "start_seconds": 103.189,
      "duration_seconds": 5.692
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "But what if we could prepare\nthe body's immune response,",
      "start_seconds": 108.881,
      "duration_seconds": 3.052
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "readying it before someone even got ill?",
      "start_seconds": 111.933,
      "duration_seconds": 3.147
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "This is where vaccines come in.",
      "start_seconds": 115.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.411
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Using the same principles\nthat the body uses to defend itself,",
      "start_seconds": 117.491,
      "duration_seconds": 3.507
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "scientists use vaccines to trigger\nthe body's adaptive immune system,",
      "start_seconds": 120.998,
      "duration_seconds": 4.977
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "without exposing humans\nto the full strength disease.",
      "start_seconds": 125.975,
      "duration_seconds": 3.706
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "This has resulted in many vaccines,\nwhich each work uniquely,",
      "start_seconds": 129.681,
      "duration_seconds": 3.878
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "separated into many different types.",
      "start_seconds": 133.559,
      "duration_seconds": 2.508
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "First, we have live attenuated vaccines.",
      "start_seconds": 136.067,
      "duration_seconds": 3.702
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "These are made of the pathogen itself\nbut a much weaker and tamer version.",
      "start_seconds": 139.769,
      "duration_seconds": 4.979
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Next, we have inactive vaccines,\nin which the pathogens have been killed.",
      "start_seconds": 144.748,
      "duration_seconds": 4.751
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "The weakening and inactivation\nin both types of vaccine",
      "start_seconds": 149.499,
      "duration_seconds": 3.029
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "ensures that pathogens don't develop\ninto the full blown disease.",
      "start_seconds": 152.528,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "But just like a disease,\nthey trigger an immune response,",
      "start_seconds": 156.438,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "teaching the body to recognize an attack",
      "start_seconds": 160.298,
      "duration_seconds": 2.154
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "by making a profile\nof pathogens in preparation.",
      "start_seconds": 162.452,
      "duration_seconds": 3.796
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "The downside is that live attenuated\nvaccines can be difficult to make,",
      "start_seconds": 166.248,
      "duration_seconds": 4.801
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "and because they're live\nand quite powerful,",
      "start_seconds": 171.049,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "people with weaker immune systems\ncan't have them,",
      "start_seconds": 173.249,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "while inactive vaccines\ndon't create long-lasting immunity.",
      "start_seconds": 176.589,
      "duration_seconds": 4.374
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Another type, the subunit vaccine,",
      "start_seconds": 180.963,
      "duration_seconds": 2.827
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "is only made from one part\nof the pathogen, called an antigen,",
      "start_seconds": 183.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.243
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "the ingredient that actually triggers\nthe immune response.",
      "start_seconds": 188.033,
      "duration_seconds": 3.536
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "By even further isolating\nspecific components of antigens,",
      "start_seconds": 191.569,
      "duration_seconds": 3.377
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "like proteins or polysaccharides,",
      "start_seconds": 194.946,
      "duration_seconds": 2.437
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "these vaccines can prompt\nspecific responses.",
      "start_seconds": 197.383,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Scientists are now building\na whole new range of vaccines",
      "start_seconds": 201.753,
      "duration_seconds": 3.918
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "called DNA vaccines.",
      "start_seconds": 205.671,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "For this variety, they isolate the very\ngenes that make the specific antigens",
      "start_seconds": 207.171,
      "duration_seconds": 4.858
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "the body needs to trigger its immune\nresponse to specific pathogens.",
      "start_seconds": 212.029,
      "duration_seconds": 4.537
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "When injected into the human body,",
      "start_seconds": 216.566,
      "duration_seconds": 2.154
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "those genes instruct cells\nin the body to make the antigens.",
      "start_seconds": 218.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.818
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "This causes a stronger immune response,",
      "start_seconds": 222.538,
      "duration_seconds": 2.442
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "and prepares the body\nfor any future threats,",
      "start_seconds": 224.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.932
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "and because the vaccine only includes\nspecific genetic material,",
      "start_seconds": 227.912,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "it doesn't contain any other ingredients\nfrom the rest of the pathogen",
      "start_seconds": 231.382,
      "duration_seconds": 3.622
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "that could develop into the disease\nand harm the patient.",
      "start_seconds": 235.004,
      "duration_seconds": 3.601
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "If these vaccines become a success,",
      "start_seconds": 238.605,
      "duration_seconds": 2.276
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "we might be able to build\nmore effective treatments",
      "start_seconds": 240.881,
      "duration_seconds": 2.634
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "for invasive pathogens in years to come.",
      "start_seconds": 243.515,
      "duration_seconds": 2.637
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Just like Edward Jenner's\namazing discovery",
      "start_seconds": 246.152,
      "duration_seconds": 2.218
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "spurred on modern medicine\nall those decades ago,",
      "start_seconds": 248.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.286
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "continuing the development of vaccines",
      "start_seconds": 251.656,
      "duration_seconds": 2.029
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "might even allow us\nto treat diseases like HIV,",
      "start_seconds": 253.685,
      "duration_seconds": 3.209
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "malaria,",
      "start_seconds": 256.894,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "or Ebola, one day.",
      "start_seconds": 257.898,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71
    }
  ]
}
